    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1037">

                <pb facs="0893" n="777" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg777"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/3548.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul at
                            Chihuahua to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Chihuahua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-09T22:00:00-07:04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 9, 1912—10 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Military authorities have confiscated a large lot of private mail sent by
                    American passenger last night. There is every reason to believe my letter to the
                    Consul at Paso del Norte, containing telegram <pb facs="0894" n="778"
                        xml:id="pg778"/> to the Department, was included. Said telegram reported the
                    expected shooting of American named Fountaine<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1037-f1"/>
                    at Parral this morning. Protested against the act last night and instructed
                    consular agent protest before the military authorities Parral. The newspapers
                    say that Fountaine was shot 5 this morning notwithstanding.</p>
                <p>Attitude rebel authorities insolent toward this office and Americans
                    generally.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Letcher.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1037-f1" n="1" xml:id="d1037-f1-content">
                <p>Elsewhere spelled Fountain.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
